    <string name="about_text">Maple runs x86-64 and ARM64 virtual machines on your phone with QEMU. No root, no accounts, no ads, no tracking – your files never leave the device.\n\nQEMU is free software licensed under the GNU GPL version 2; its source code and the build scripts are in the native/qemu directory of this app\'s source tree.\n\nMaple is not affiliated with QEMU, Microsoft, Google or any operating system vendor. All names are trademarks of their respective owners.</string>

